# Economy → Investments: the mouse wheel moves both lists by half a stock card a notch (the
# game's own step is 52 pixels, under a third of a card). Reads only.
name investments: the mouse wheel scrolls both lists half a card a notch
show-economy
wait 2
expect-wheel-step InvestmentsScrollablePanel 80
expect-wheel-step OwnedInvestmentsScrollablePanel 80
cleanup:
close-economy
